#%%   computes an NSCF band path, and dataset 3 stores an accurately converged
#%%   IBZ WFK. Dataset 4 expands it to the full Brillouin zone and uses
#%%   wfk_task "wannier" to Wannierize the first four bands.
#%% topics = Wannier
